No third-party case design, logos, artwork, scans or textures are included.
Archetype case and pocket sizes are original choices, not measurements of any
manufacturer's packaging. Disc diameter/hole reference the keystone CD standard
part; clearance, retention profiles and every shell/clip detail remain ours.

The living-hinge motion is a constant-length kinematic spine arc. It explains
unfolding and preserves a continuous geometric skin; it is not a material,
strain, fatigue or manufacturability simulation. Named presets require sourced
closed envelopes and capacity/retention. They are fit proxies, not replicas or
physical-compatibility guarantees. No historical SKU is asserted by an archetype.
